{
  "comment": "Voice bank manifest. FEMALE voices are MeloTTS (myshell-ai, MIT) across six languages (en/es/fr/zh/ja/ko) — each a full MeloTTS (PyTorch) checkpoint + that language's sentence-BERT, rendered by one shared frozen engine (engines.melotts_full); MeloTTS is the quality floor the owner accepts. MALE voices: en_male = Kokoro bm_daniel (British RP) and es_male = Kokoro em_alex — Kokoro-82M (hexgrad), Apache-2.0, one shared ONNX model; fr_male = Piper UPMC pierre (small ONNX, CC-BY-SA-4.0, from the official rhasspy/piper-voices repo). zh/ja/ko are FEMALE-ONLY for now — no commercially-licensable male neural TTS covers Mandarin/Japanese/Korean (Piper has no ja/ko; Kokoro's CJK males are below the quality floor; every Korean-capable open model is voice-cloning or GPU-only). Bundled in the Steam depot for an instant first-run voice: English HD (MeloTTS female) plus the Kokoro engine + shared model — so en_male (bm_daniel), the default pack's voice, is ready with no download; the other languages download on demand. sha256/sizeBytes are enforced by the downloader. wpmAtScale1 null = default baseline. The `excluded` list below is the historical Piper-era licence audit, kept for record.",
